Windows Registry Editor Version 5.00

; HID power management off (mouse, keyboard, controllers)
; Source: MaxxTopia catalog (process.hid-power-mgmt.disable, mechanism tier)
; Companion to usb-power-mgmt-off.reg — covers HID-class devices at the
; driver layer. Prevents Windows from power-managing your mouse/keyboard/
;controller into a state that adds wake latency.
; Registry: HKLM\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\hidclass\Parameters\EnhancedPowerManagementEnabled
; Value 0 = enhanced power management disabled. Default = key absent.
; Reboot required: yes
; Revert: delete the EnhancedPowerManagementEnabled value

[HKEY_LOCAL_MACHINE\SYSTEM\CurrentControlSet\Services\hidclass\Parameters]
"EnhancedPowerManagementEnabled"=dword:00000000
